menu "Michi Music Stream LED"

    config MICHI_LED_COUNT
        int "Number of SK6812 status LEDs"
        default 3
        range 1 64
        help
          LEDs on the M5Stack U003 status board (phase 7). The cat-contour
          strip is NOT supported (project restriction: no second channel).

    config MICHI_LED_MAX_BRIGHTNESS_PCT
        int "Maximum LED brightness (percent)"
        default 25
        range 1 100
        help
          Global brightness cap applied to EVERY pixel in software (all
          colors are scaled by this/100 in the animation task, never in
          hardware). SK6812 at full brightness is blinding in a dark room;
          the 25% default keeps the status LEDs visible but comfortable.
          Raise only if the LEDs are meant to be seen from a distance.

    config MICHI_LED_TASK_STACK_BYTES
        int "LED animation task stack (bytes)"
        default 3072
        range 2048 16384
        help
          Stack of the LED animation task (ESP-IDF xTaskCreate takes bytes).
          The task only computes pixel colors from the precomputed sine LUT
          and calls led_strip_set_pixel/refresh per tick, so the default is
          generous.

endmenu
